530 回归失败项与未改动基线副本的对照记录
==================================================
目的：判定 lease 包与 storage 包的两项既有用例失败是否为本次改动引入。
方法：从交付提交的仓库直接检出基线 e9e56564d6f13af87747cdb785bc1832791090b4 到独立目录
      （git worktree add --detach），把 Windows 下 client/v3 符号链接占位按同样方式补齐后，
      以与交付副本完全相同的命令运行同一批用例。

1) go test ./lease/ -run TestLessorCheckpointsRestoredOnPromote -count=1
   交付副本：FAIL  lessor_test.go:600: expected expiry to be less than 1s in the future, but got 5.000000 seconds
   基线副本：FAIL  lessor_test.go:600: expected expiry to be less than 1s in the future, but got 5.000000 seconds
   结论：两处完全相同，属既有失败，与本次改动无关。

2) go test ./storage/mvcc/ -run TestStoreRev -count=1
   交付副本：FAIL  testing.go:1464: TempDir RemoveAll cleanup: unlinkat ...\database: The process cannot access
                    the file because it is being used by another process.
   基线副本：FAIL  testing.go:1464: TempDir RemoveAll cleanup: unlinkat ...\database: The process cannot access
                    the file because it is being used by another process.
   结论：两处完全相同，失败原因只是 Windows 下临时目录无法删除仍被占用的数据库文件，与本次改动无关。

完整套件结果：go test ./lease/... ./storage/mvcc/... -count=1
   ok  lease/leasehttp；lease 与 storage/mvcc 仅上述两项失败，其余全部通过。

附：本次改动引入的并发缺陷证据（logs/530-adv2.log、logs/530-attach-panic-stack.txt）
